# The data files whose strings are translated: the desktop entry and the
# AppStream metainfo. Their templates are installed (the desktop file and the
# metainfo are generated from them by `msgfmt`, see `data/`), so the
# strings live in the `.in` files and not in the installed ones.
#
# `extract-pot` extracts these by extension — the desktop entry with
# `--language=Desktop`, the metainfo through gettext's ITS rules — and
# `tests/i18n.rs` checks this list against the tree, the way it checks
# `po/POTFILES` against this crate's sources.
data/org.yangtse.Pixlay.desktop.in
data/org.yangtse.Pixlay.metainfo.xml.in
